ion x-men brings a  crowded slate of classic marvel  characters to the screen with a talented  ensemble cast and surprisingly sharp  narrative focus  [Music]  hmm  [Music]  number six deadpool 2.  wisecracking mercenary deadpool meets  russell an angry teenage mutant who  lives at an orphanage when russell  becomes a target of cable deadpool  realizes that he'll need some help  saving the boy from such a superior  enemy he soon joins forces with bedlim  shatterstar domino and other powerful  mutants to protect young russell from  cable and his advanced weaponry starring  ryan reynolds josh brolin zazzy beats  and directed by david leach critics say  though it threatens to buckle under the  weight of its meta gags deadpool 2 is a  gory gleeful lampoon of the superhero  genre buoyed by ryan reynolds's  undeniable charm  give me your best shot one-eyed willy  oh  those bullets are like super fast  here we go  [Music]  [Music]  number five x2 x-men united  striker a villainous former army  commander holds the key to wolverine's  past and the future of the x-men this  threat reignites the call for a mutant  registration act striker starts a  full-out assault on professor xavier's  mansion in school and after escaping his  plastic cell magneto proposes a  partnership with xavier and the x-men to  combat this new formidable enemy they  both have in common starring patrick  stewart hugh jackman and halle berry  critics say tightly scripted solidly  acted and impressively ambitious x2  x-men united is bigger and better than  its predecessor and a benchmark for  comic sequels in general  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  oh my god  roof  [Music]  number four deadpool  wade wilson is a former special forces  operative who now works as a mercenary  his world comes crashing down when evil  scientist ajax tortures disfigures and  transforms him into deadpool the rogue  experiment leaves deadpool with  accelerated healing powers and a twisted  sense of humor with help from mutant  allies